              "latex": "f:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " is said to be periodic if its values repeat at regular intervals. Such functions are used throughout mathematics and science to describe oscillations, waves, and other phenomena. Formally, a function ",
